# 24. Configuration Overview

The complete setup can be summarized as:

```text
                    SMB CLIENT
                        |
                        | TCP/445
                        |
                        v
                +---------------+
                |    Samba      |
                |     smbd      |
                +---------------+
                        |
                Authentication
                        |
                        v
                 Samba database
                        |
                        v
                Share permissions
                        |
                        v
              Linux filesystem
                        |
                        v
              /srv/samba/share
```

The complete process is:

```text
1. Install Samba
       ↓
2. Create Linux group
       ↓
3. Create Linux user
       ↓
4. Create shared directory
       ↓
5. Configure Linux permissions
       ↓
6. Create Samba account
       ↓
7. Configure /etc/samba/smb.conf
       ↓
8. Run testparm
       ↓
9. Restart smbd
       ↓
10. Check TCP/445
       ↓
11. Test with smbclient
       ↓
12. Test from another client
```

